WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:01.985
(uplifting music)

00:00:01.985 --> 00:00:04.235
(chanting)

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:07.200
- I want my daughter and
the rest of the Monarchs

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:12.200
to grow up in a world that
sees them and affirms them

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:16.640
and that gives them the
space to be able to show up

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:19.670
as their full selves to
celebrate who they are

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:21.083
as young girls of color.

00:00:28.996 --> 00:00:30.870
(upbeat music)

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:32.390
My name is Anayvette Martinez,

00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:34.940
and I am one of the co-founders
of the Radical Monarchs.

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:37.963
- And my name is Lupita Martinez,
and I'm a Radical Monarch.

00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:40.510
- [Narrator] The Radical Monarchs

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:43.480
is a progressive scouting
troop for young girls of color.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:45.520
The troop's mission is
to create opportunities

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:47.660
for the girls to form a fierce sisterhood,

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:48.980
celebrate their identities

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:51.493
and contribute radically
to their communities.

00:00:54.483 --> 00:00:57.130
- I launched the Radical
Monarchs in December of 2014

00:00:57.130 --> 00:00:59.200
because when Lupita was in fourth grade

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.653
she wanted to join a local scouting troop.

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:04.920
I felt like the traditional scouting group

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.960
wouldn't really speak to her experience

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:08.360
as a young girl of color and as a girl

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:11.180
that's been raised with
really radical politics.

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:13.410
And, so, I had this idea
of what would it look like

00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:15.344
to start a different kind of troop

00:01:15.344 --> 00:01:17.280
where girls could earn badges,

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:18.510
but that the badges they earned

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:21.583
were based on social
justice issues and topics.

00:01:23.114 --> 00:01:25.470
(gentle music)

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:27.380
- [Narrator] The Monarchs
earn badges for each unit

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:29.500
that they cover, and each
badge has an activity

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:32.550
out in the community, like
participating in marches,

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:35.260
meeting with legislators
and talking with activists

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:36.573
who came before them.

00:01:38.710 --> 00:01:42.010
- Some of the badges that
we've earned are Radical Roots,

00:01:42.010 --> 00:01:44.770
Radical Bodies and then
our newest one today,

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:46.083
which was Radical Media.

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:50.100
For the Radical Healing badge,

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:51.730
we learned about
different ways of healing,

00:01:51.730 --> 00:01:53.650
healing with plants, healing with herbs.

00:01:53.650 --> 00:01:55.730
And then, for the Black
Lives Matter badge,

00:01:55.730 --> 00:01:58.103
we went to the Martin Luther King march.

00:01:59.402 --> 00:02:02.220
(upbeat music)

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:03.850
- [Narrator] The Radical
Monarchs recently started

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:05.890
their second troop and hope to expand

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:07.603
to reach even more girls.

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:12.880
- My vision and dream for the Monarchs

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:16.070
is that we have troops and chapters

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:18.720
wherever we're needed and wanted.

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:21.800
As it is right now, we
get requests constantly

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:25.143
from all over the country,
all over the world even.

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:27.900
Especially in today's climate,

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:30.533
I think that is needed now more than ever.

